  "context": {
    "explanation_en": "'A different kettle of fish' (a completely different matter), 'let the cat out of the bag' (reveal a secret accidentally), 'kill two birds with one stone' (accomplish two things at once), 'the elephant in the room' (an obvious problem nobody wants to discuss).",
    "explanation_ko": "'a different kettle of fish'(완전히 다른 문제), 'let the cat out of the bag'(실수로 비밀을 누설하다), 'kill two birds with one stone'(한 번에 두 가지를 이루다), 'the elephant in the room'(아무도 얘기하고 싶어하지 않는 명백한 문제).",
    "key_expressions": [
      {
        "en": "That's a different kettle of fish entirely.",
        "ko": "그건 완전히 다른 문제예요."
      },
      {
        "en": "Oops, I let the cat out of the bag.",
        "ko": "이런, 제가 비밀을 누설해버렸어요."
      },
      {
        "en": "We can kill two birds with one stone.",
        "ko": "우리는 일석이조로 해결할 수 있어요."
      }
    ]
  },
